理、背景环境及模特姿态均严禁改动 → 动作不变、体型未改、面容不动；\n- ❗ 色彩系统强制锁定：“图二”内所有颜色值（包括金属、宝石、织物等）必须精确映射至最终画面，拒绝漂移、混搭或降级渲染；\n- ❗ 不得新增光源、阴影、反射干扰，确保整体光照风格与“图一”一致。\n\n📌 输出标准：\n生成结果应呈现如“图一+图二融合”，但本质是“局部置换式增强”，非合成拼接。输出图像清晰度不低于原图分辨率，构图稳定，焦点集中于被修改区域，并维持原有场景氛围完整性。\n\n—\n\n此提示适用于支持精细物件定位和多模态图文对齐的专业图像编辑器 / AI绘图工具，请勿跳过以上任一条约束项。\n\n\n> ✍️ 建议搭配使用时附带：[插入两张参考图编号] + [指定目标手部坐标区段]\n\n—— 编辑师认证模板·v1.0 ——"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 130, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 101, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 44}, {"outputs": [{"name": "*", "links": [155], "type": "*"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["出图在这里"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "easy getNode", "title": "⬅️出图在这里", "mode": 4, "size": [210, 58], "pos": [4100, 1330], "id": 123, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [{"name": "*", "links": [149], "type": "*"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["请上传衣服或者其他"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "easy getNode", "title": "⬅️请上传衣服或者其他", "mode": 4, "size": [210, 58], "pos": [3997.954833984375, 733.6209716796875], "id": 118, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [147], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [270, 314.0001220703125], "pos": [3800, 1430], "widgets_values": ["49870d005362231b1abc0c7f2e17af27339d7ff68dcaaef04633330015279d7e.jpg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 97, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#223", "w